/lanmai-tueenana.html\">Tuè時代ê進步，ná教ná學</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 黃明勝</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">38</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/04/lanmai-taoa.html\">어쩔수가없다，無ta你ôa</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ Tân Lō͘</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台灣人寫真</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">15</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/04/e_21.html\">我ê囡仔時代</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 林幸雪</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted